, "widgets_values": ["A highly detailed, immersive portrait of a young East Asian woman seated in a sun-drenched field of golden grasses during the soft, amber glow of golden hour. Her face is turned gently toward the camera with a serene, contemplative expression — her dark, wavy hair is loosely tied back, with wispy tendrils framing her cheeks and catching the backlight, creating a halo effect around her silhouette. Her skin is luminous and softly textured, adorned with delicate natural makeup — subtle blush on her cheeks, a whisper of pink on her lips, and a few small, artfully placed beauty marks near her jawline and temple.\n\nShe wears a flowing, semi-sheer white blouse made of intricate lace or gauze fabric, featuring ruffled sleeves, a softly gathered yoke, and a row of small, metallic buttons down the front. The fabric clings delicately to her form while billowing softly around her arms, revealing glimpses of skin beneath — its texture rendered with fine threads, subtle translucency, and gentle folds that catch the warm light. Her posture is relaxed yet poised, one arm resting lightly along her side, the other partially visible near her lap, where she appears to be wearing dark polka-dotted bottoms.\n\nThe background is a dreamy bokeh of tall, swaying grasses — some in sharp focus near the foreground, others dissolving into a honeyed haze behind her. Sunlight filters through the stalks, casting dappled shadows and creating a luminous atmosphere filled with floating dust particles and ethereal glow. In the far distance, soft rolling hills fade into a warm, hazy sky, adding depth and tranquility to the scene. The overall lighting is directional and warm — golden rays from the low sun bathe her left side, sculpting her features with soft highlights and casting gentle shadows that enhance the contours of her face and clothing. The mood is tender, nostalgic, and quietly romantic — evoking the feeling of a fleeting moment frozen in time, where nature and human beauty harmonize under the touch of sunset."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 4, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [410.52789306640625, 687.9261474609375], "pos": [1685.9283447265625, 575.2025146484375], "id": 5, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [6], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 10, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 17, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [377.1929626464844, 88], "pos": [1706.8741455078125, 1637.69091796875], "id": 8, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [21], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [270, 106], "pos": [2644.858154296875, 1489.036865234375], "widgets_values": [0.015000000000000003, 0.45000000000000007, 4], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 20, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "grain_intensity"}, "name": "grain_intensity", "label": "grain_intensity", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "grain_intensity"}, {"widget": {"name": "saturation_mix"}, "name": "saturation_mix", "label": "saturation_mix", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "saturation_mix"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 21, "type": "FastFilmGrain", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "FastFilmGrain